{"version":"2.3.4","record_id":"","chat":"120363144011863882@g.us","sender":"6282113804670@s.whatsapp.net","sender_jid":"6282113804670@s.whatsapp.net","sender_lid":"90735529431176@lid","sender_push_name":"fay","sender_phone":"6282113804670","is_group":true,"is_from_me":false,"message_id":"ACB72DF7A346403449872916DC64354C","message_type":"text","message_text":"﷽\n\n اَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكُمْ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ\nالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ الَّذِيْ بِنِعْمَتِهِ تَتِمُّ  الصَّالِحَاتُ\n\nSemoga kita semua selalu sehat, bersemangat dalam beribadah dan beramal sholih, dan dimampukan Allah agar istiqomah dalam menuntut ilmu syar'i. Aamiin\n\nMari kita buka halaqoh hari ini dengan membaca *Bismillāh* dan doa: \n\n*اَللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَسْأَلُكَ عِلْماً نَافِعاً، وَرِزْقاً طَيِّباً، وَعَمَلاً مُتَقَبَّلاً*\n\nSesungguhnya aku memohon kepada-Mu ilmu yang bermanfaat,  rezeki yang baik dan amal yang diterima“.* (Hadits Riwayat Ahmad, Ibnu Majah dan Ibnu as-Sunni). \n────⊱◈🌺🌺◈⊰────","message_text_id":"","message_timestamp":"2026-08-26T18:49:55+07:00","message_raw":"","attachment_url":"","attachment_id":"","attachment_type":"","attachment_name":"","from_id":"6282113804670@s.whatsapp.net","from_name":"fay","from_group_id":"120363144011863882@g.us","from_group_name":"Tahfidz Private (15) AK","to_id":"","to_name":"","to_group_id":"120363144011863882@g.us","to_group_name":"Tahfidz Private (15) AK","context":{"body":"","id":"","jid":"","type":"text"}}

